#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:21 91f14f9896ac40279a88b284adb2d01d
msgid ""
"Stores :ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>` instances and their routing, mixing state, and"
" effects. The layout managed by :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` is synchronized from "
":ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>`; an independently created layout requires explicit "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""
"保存  :ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>`  实例及其路由、混音状态和效果器。\\  "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`  管理的布局会从  :ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>`  "
"同步；独立创建的布局需要显式同步。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:86 c4098b874719471689f11fc7ff0df91e
msgid ""
"\\ :ref:`sync_from_audio_server()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_sync_from_audio_server>` "
"creates the master bus when needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`sync_from_audio_server()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_sync_from_audio_server>`  "
"会在需要时创建主总线。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:198 3457959362224196bc0f0086efd51382
msgid ""
"Returns the bus's stored user mute flag. It does not include muting caused by another bus's "
"solo state."
msgstr "返回总线保存的用户静音标志，不包含其他总线独奏造成的静音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:284 eb0ef61290ec4e6ea7c79aa2519956e8
msgid ""
"Synchronizes bus names, routing, volume, mute, solo, and supported enabled effects from "
":ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>`. Unsupported effect types are skipped."
msgstr "从  :ref:`AudioServer<class_AudioServer>`  同步总线名称、路由、音量、静音、独奏以及受支持且已启用的效果器。不支持的效果器类型会被跳过。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:286 f9015ebf30684669af63a8e34b4cb826
msgid ""
"The layout managed by :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` is synchronized automatically. "
"Independently created layouts must be synchronized explicitly."
msgstr ":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`  管理的布局会自动同步。独立创建的布局需显式调用同步。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:298 488cab2e0dec4c8d9fa40e3986f16b98
msgid ""
"Checks for changes and updates the layout or bus state when needed. Returns ``true`` when an "
"update was triggered. Bus and effect-slot checks are spread across calls, so a single call "
"may not detect every change."
msgstr "检查变化，并在需要时更新布局或总线状态。触发更新时返回  ``true`` \\ 。总线和效果器槽位的检查分散到多次调用中，单次调用可能无法发现所有变化。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobuslayout.rst:84 743d2cff53914664ab7ba8b712fcf7e6
msgid ""
"Creates a bus with ``name`` and routes it to ``parent``'s channel group. An omitted parent "
"routes to the master group. A parent without an initialized channel group is rejected without"
" adding a bus."
msgstr "创建名为  ``name``  的总线，并路由到  ``parent``  的通道组。未指定父级时路由到主通道组。父级没有有效通道组时拒绝创建，不会添加总线。"
